{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43207","headline":"旅泊江津言怀 · 贾宗","name":"旅泊江津言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征途几迢遰，客子倦西东。\n乘流如泛梗，逐吹似惊蓬。\n飘颻万里外，辛苦百年中。\n异县心期阻，他乡风月同。\n云归全岭暗，日落半江红。\n自然堪迸泪，非是泣途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}